# .gitignore chung cho mọi service trong CareConnect/.
# Pattern không có "/" ở đầu nên áp dụng cho mọi thư mục con (IdentityService/, service sau này...).

### Maven / build ###
target/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
HELP.md

### Local credentials and signing keys ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
keys/
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.jks

### Logs ###
*.log
logs/

### STS ###
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/

### NetBeans ###
nbproject/private/
nbbuild/
dist/
nbdist/
.nb-gradle/

